  "text": "第三十二单元\n第一课\n【对话场景】去修车行取车\n——Is my car ready yet?\n我的车修好了吗？\n——I don't know, sir.\n我不知道，先生。\nWhat's the licence number of your car?\n您的车牌号是多少？\n——It's G88998.\nG88998。\n——When did you bring it to us?\n您是什么时候把车送过来修的？\n——I brought it here three days ago.\n我三天前把车送过来的。\n——Ah yes, I remember now.\n是的，我现在想起来了。\n——Have your mechanics finished yet?\n你们的机械师修好了吗？\n——No, they're still working on it.\n没有，他们还在修。\nLet's go into the garage and have a look at it.\n我们一起去车库看看吧。\n——Isn't that your car?\n那不就是您的车吗？\n——Well, it was my car.\n是的，那曾是我的车。\n——Didn't your wife have a crash?\n是不是您妻子发生交通事故了？\n——That's right. She drove it into a lamp post.\n是的，她撞到路灯杆子上了。\nCan your mechanics repair it?\n机械师能把车修好吗？\n——Well, they're trying to repair it, sir.\n他们正在努力修呢，先生。\nBut to tell you the truth, you need a new car.\n不过，说实话，您该换辆新车了。\n• work on 的用法\n◦ 意思是“继续工作，继续做······”，后面加名词或代词\n▪ He worked on in the office until ten o'clock last night.\n他昨晚在办公室工作到了十点。\n◦ 其他常见的意思\n▪ 致力于，从事于\n▫ The scientists are still working on inventing an effective\nmedicine.\n科学家们还在致力于研发一种有效的药物。\n▪ 说服，劝说\n▫ In order to make him accept our suggestion, I decided to work\non him immediately.\n为了让他接受我们的建议，我决定立刻劝说他。\n▪ 对······发生影响，对······起作用\n▫ The doctor told him that this kind of medicine may work on him.\n医生对他说这种药对他可能有效。\n• try 的用法\n◦ 意思是“尝试”，可以作动词也可以作名词\n▪ 动词：试图、想要、设法、审理\n▪ 名词：尝试、持球触地\n◦ 及物动词的用法\n▪ try to do 努力做某事\n▫ We are trying to improve the condition.\n我们正在努力改善条件。\n▪ try doing 尝试做某事\n▫ Let's try listening to some music.\n我们试试看听点音乐。\n▪ try out 实验做某事\n▫ It sounds great but the result has to be tried out.\n听起来不错，但最终还是要看实验的结果。\n▪ try 审理案件\n▫ Their case will be tried next month.\n他们的案子下个月就会审理了。\n◦ 常见的搭配\n▪ try one's best 尽某人最大的努力\n▪ try one's fortune 碰运气\n▪ try on 试穿\n▪ have a try 试试看\n• to tell you the truth 的用法\n◦ 意思是“实话告诉你”，可以单独使用，要加定冠词\n▪ To tell you the truth, I was afraid to see him. 说实在的，我害怕见\n他。\n◦ 同义替换\n▪ to be honest 老实说\n▫ To be honest, I just don't want to go. 老实说，我真的不想去。\n▪ frankly 坦白讲\n▫ Quite frankly, I am not surprised you failed.坦白讲，我对你的失败\n并不意外。\n▪ honestly speaking 实话说\n▫ Honestly speaking, I am disappointed.实话说，我很失望。\n▪ in fact / as a matter of fact 事实上\n▫ In fact, those people have been promoted.事实上，那些人已经升\n职了。\n第二课\n【语法点拨】动词的过去分词\n过去分词一般表示完成和被动的动作，动词的过去分词可以分为两种：规则的动词原\n形+ed，不规则的动词逐个记忆。\n• 过去分词的用法\n◦ 作表语，表示被动或者表示主语所处的状态\n▪ I am pleased to be invited.能被邀请，我感到很高兴。\n◦ 作定语，表示完成和被动。但不及物动词的过去分词作定语不表示被动，仅\n表示完成\n▪ There are many fallen leaves on the ground.地上有很多落叶。\n◦ 作动词 see, feel, hear, notice, watch, make, let, get 等连用作宾补\n▪ She heard the door beaten by someone.她听到有人在用力敲门。\n◦ 作状语，表示时间、原因、让步、条件、伴随和结果等\n▪ Disappointed, she left the city. 因为失望，她离开了这座城市。\n• 常见的不规则动词的过去分词\n◦ AAA 型\n打赌\nbet bet bet\n广播\nbroadcast broadcast broadcast\n爆发\nburst burst burst\n投掷\ncast cast cast\n花费\ncost cost cost\n切，割\ncut cut cut\n预报\nforecast forecast/ forecast/\nforecasted forecasted\n打\nhit hit hit\n伤害\nhurt hurt hurt\n编织\nknit knit/ knitted knit/ knitted\n让\nlet let let\n放\nput put put\n停止\nquit quit/quitted quit/quitted\n◦ ABB 型\n▪ 在动词原形后面加（e）d 或 t 构成过去式、过去分词\n听见\nhear heard heard\n燃烧\nburn burnt/ burned burnt/ burned\n学习\nlearn learnt/learned learnt/learned\n梦想\ndream dreamed/dreamt dreamed/dreamt\n意思是\nmean meant meant\n倾斜\nlean leant/leaned leant/leaned\n跳跃\nleap leapt/ leaped leapt/ leaped\n破坏，宠坏\nspoil spoilt/spoiled spoilt/spoiled\n处理\ndeal dealt dealt\n▪ 把动词原形的最后一个辅音字母 d 改成 t\n建设\nbuild built built\n重建\nrebuild rebuilt rebuilt\n借出\nlend lent lent\n寄；发射\nsend sent sent\n度过；花费\nspend spent spent\n弯曲\nbend bent bent\n▪ 把 eel，ell 改成 elt\n感觉\nfeel felt felt\n跪下\nkneel knelt knelt\n闻到\nsmell smelt smelt\n拼写\nspell spelt spelt\n◦ ABC 型\n▪ 动词原形+n 或 en 构成过去分词\n拿，取\ntake took taken\n误会\nmistake mistook mistaken\n承担\nundertake undertook undertaken\n摇晃\nshake shook shaken\n看见\nsee saw seen\n预见\nforesee foresaw foreseen\n吃\neat ate eaten\n跌倒\nfall fell fallen\n给\ngive gave given\n原谅\nforgive forgave forgiven\n驾驶\ndrive drove driven\n升起\nrise rose risen\n出现\narise arose arisen\n▪ 过去式+n 构成过去分词\n打破\nbreak broke broken\n说话\nspeak spoke spoken\n结冰；冷藏\nfreeze froze frozen\n醒\nwake woke woken\n唤醒\nawake awoke awoken\n选择\nchoose chose chosen\n偷\nsteal stole stolen\n第三课\n【单词串烧】\n• attendant [ə'tendənt] n.接待员\n• bring [briŋ] v.带来，送来\n• garage ['gærɑ:ʒ] n.车库，汽车修理厂\n• crash [kræʃ] n.碰撞\n• lamp-post [læmp pəust] 灯杆\n• repair [ri'peə] v.修理\n• try [trai] v.努力，设法\n• jeep [dʒi:p] n.吉普车\n• truck [trʌk] n.卡车\n• taxi [ˈtæksi] n.出租汽车\n• saloon [səˈluːn] n.小轿车\n• Paris ['pæris] n.巴黎\n• cinema ['sinimə] n.电影院\n• film [film] n.电影\n• beautiful ['bju:tifəl] a.漂亮的\n• city ['siti] n.城市\n• never ['nevə] ad.从来没有\n• ever ['evə] ad.在任何时候",
