      "text": "【对话场景】去修车行取车"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——Is my car ready yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "我的车修好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——I don't know, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "我不知道，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What's the licence number of your car?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "您的车牌号是多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——It's G88998."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "G88998。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——When did you bring it to us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "您是什么时候把车送过来修的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——I brought it here three days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "我三天前把车送过来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——Ah yes, I remember now."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "是的，我现在想起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——Have your mechanics finished yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "你们的机械师修好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——No, they're still working on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "没有，他们还在修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Let's go into the garage and have a look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "我们一起去车库看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——Isn't that your car?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "那不就是您的车吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——Well, it was my car."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "是的，那曾是我的车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——Didn't your wife have a crash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "是不是您妻子发生交通事故了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——That's right. She drove it into a lamp post."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "是的，她撞到路灯杆子上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Can your mechanics repair it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "机械师能把车修好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "——Well, they're trying to repair it, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "他们正在努力修呢，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "But to tell you the truth, you need a new car."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "不过，说实话，您该换辆新车了。"
    },
